META|Cluster-SSG Documentation & Guide|Alamgir ZK|2026-11-15|default|docs,guide,cli,tutorial|cluster-ssg-documentation--guide|Complete CLI reference and syntax guide for Cluster-SSG.
BLOCKS_COUNT|16
BLOCK|h1|1|Documentation & CLI Guide 📖
BLOCK|p||Get started with Cluster-SSG in seconds.
BLOCK|h2|2|CLI Commands
BLOCK|code|bash|# Build the entire static site into dist/
cluster-ssg build

# Start the preview development server on localhost:3000
cluster-ssg serve

# Start development server with binary wire security
cluster-ssg serve --binary

# Pack a .cld document into a .clb binary bundle
cluster-ssg pack site/pages/index.cld dist/index.clb

# Unpack a .clb binary bundle back to human-readable .cld
cluster-ssg unpack dist/index.clb site/pages/reconstructed.cld

# Run the Hugo-speed in-memory benchmark (1,000 pages)
cluster-ssg bench
BLOCK|hr||
BLOCK|h2|2|The .cld Document Format
BLOCK|p||Each `.cld` file contains a structured header followed by the `===` splitter:
BLOCK|code|cld|title: My First Article
author: Jane Doe
date: 2026-11-15
layout: post
tags: cluster,web,tutorial
description: A quick start guide.
===

# Heading 1
This is a paragraph with **bold**, *italic*, and `inline code`.

<island name="Counter" client:load count="10" />
BLOCK|hr||
BLOCK|h2|2|Component Islands & Partial Hydration
BLOCK|p||Cluster-SSG supports 4 client hydration directives:
BLOCK|list||`client:load` - Hydrates immediately on page load
BLOCK|list||`client:idle` - Hydrates when browser enters idle state
BLOCK|list||`client:visible` - Hydrates when the element enters viewport
BLOCK|list||`client:zero-js` - Renders statically with zero client-side JavaScript
BLOCK|island|visible||SearchModal
ISLANDS_COUNT|1
ISLAND|SearchModal|visible||
